  noteTitle: Students Notes 3/4 Discussion
  noteContent: At the last meeting, Kowalski blurted out that "CRT is a stable matrix
    for unstable consciousness." It sounded smart, although no one asked what exactly
    he meant. Maybe he meant that these old monitors tolerate chaos better than we
    do?
